WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.427
Which subscription actually fits your business?

00:00:02.427 --> 00:00:06.471
I am PARIS, your AI presenter for Elevate for Humanity.

00:00:06.471 --> 00:00:12.133
The store currently lists Solo at twenty nine dollars
per month, Business at fifty

00:00:12.133 --> 00:00:14.559
nine, and Professional at ninety nine.

00:00:14.559 --> 00:00:16.177
Enterprise is quoted separately.

00:00:16.177 --> 00:00:21.839
These are software subscriptions, separate from training
tuition and separate from following this podcast.

00:00:21.839 --> 00:00:24.670
The plan page also lists optional modules.

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:29.523
The four assistant bundle is listed at seventy nine
dollars a month.

00:00:29.523 --> 00:00:35.185
Course Creation and Learning Platform is listed at
seventy nine dollars a month, with

00:00:35.185 --> 00:00:37.207
twenty five hundred monthly credits.

00:00:37.207 --> 00:00:41.656
Check which base plan and add ons your selected setup
requires.

00:00:41.656 --> 00:00:47.318
For example, a solo professional who needs a basic web
presence has a different

00:00:47.318 --> 00:00:50.958
problem from a training provider managing learners and
assessments.

00:00:50.958 --> 00:00:56.620
Start with the problem you need solved, then ask which
specific capabilities are included.

00:00:56.620 --> 00:01:01.877
Check user limits, generation credits, usage charges,
billing terms, and support before purchasing.

00:01:01.877 --> 00:01:06.731
A higher price does not automatically make a plan the
right fit.

00:01:06.731 --> 00:01:12.393
The store advertises a fourteen day organization trial
with no card required; confirm the

00:01:12.393 --> 00:01:15.224
current trial details when you sign up.

00:01:15.224 --> 00:01:20.886
Prices in this episode were checked October twenty
fifth, twenty twenty six, and can

00:01:20.886 --> 00:01:21.290
change.

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:24.525
Use the live plans link for your decision.

00:01:24.525 --> 00:01:26.952
Following Elevate on Spotify is free.

